# Conspiracy Unraveler's alternative cost and a spell's own "collect evidence" additional cost are each collecting evidence (CR 701.59a; the 2024-02-02 ruling):
# with Surveillance Monitor out ("Whenever you collect evidence, create a 1/1 Thopter"), Bot1 casts Crimestopper Sprite on turn 5 for "collect evidence 10"
# (Emrakul, the Promised End, 13) rather than its mana cost, and also collects evidence 6 (Craw Wurm, 6) as its optional additional cost: two collections,
# two Thopters, and the Sprite's stun counter, since its own evidence was collected. The Monitor's own "you may collect evidence 4" was declined: no Thopter from it.

